     1,
     "Hi,<p>qplot(color, data=diamonds, geom=&#39;bar&#39;)<p>The above command won&#39;t plot the bars if I only have the height of each bar.<br>height_of_bars=table(diamonds$color)<p>Suppose that I have the heights of each bar, is there a command to<br>plot the bars. plot() can plot vertical lines, but I&#39;d like bars.<p>-- <br>Regards,<br>Peng<br></p></p></p></p>"
    ]
   ]
  },
