     1,
     "<p>Of course you will. But you misunderstood me.<p>I&#39;m asking if I have a vector(see below), how to plot a bar plot with<br>three bars (A,B,C) each with height 50, 60 and 70.<p>c(A=50,B=60,C=70)<p></p></p></p></p>"
